expectLinearGrowth(asciiProse, 1000, 'ASCII prose', elapsedUs: spike.call);
// Layout guard: 3 attempts × 2 sizes × 5 timed runs. If the measure
// loop's call layout ever changes, the spike indices above silently
// shift — this assertion turns that into a loud failure.
expect(spike.calls, 30);
```

