/// The compact tool-row grammar (issue #366): every builtin tool renders as
/// `<glyph> <label> · <detail> <elapsed>` — oh-my-pi-style, brand-colored,
/// budget-aware.
///
/// Pure layout + human-detail extraction; palette escapes are NEVER baked
